            "review_title": "Review at Chang Kang Kung",
            "review_text": "Sokka W\n1 contribution\n0\nFirst and last time\nJul 2026 • Family\nWe had a very disappointing experience. We were told the wait would be about 45 minutes, but it ended up taking nearly two hours. The reservation/waitlist system seemed poorly managed, as several walk-in customers who arrived after us were seated ahead of us, making it feel like the order was not being honored.\n\nUnfortunately, the food did not make up for the wait. It did not taste fresh, and the sauce was particularly unpleasant. Based on our experience, the quality of the food raised concerns for us.\n\nThe dining environment was also frustrating. Since it was our first visit, we didn’t know what to expect, but many customers waiting appeared impatient and inconsiderate. Several parties lingered at their tables long after finishing their meals while a long line of people waited outside, which only made the already excessive wait worse.\n\nThe only positive was that the front desk staff remained polite throughout the experience.\n\nOverall, between the extremely long wait, disorganized seating process, disappointing food, and poor overall experience, we would not return.\nRead more\nWritten July 3, 2026",
