            "review_title": "Review at Chang Kang Kung",
            "review_text": "Dang V\nirvine, United States12 contributions\n0\nCompletely new style of eating!\nSep 2019\nIt's not often you try a new cuisine, much less a new cuisine cooked in a style never seen before. You order a bunch of dishes, and each dish is steamed in front of you in this innovative steamer pot. But the real trick is the rice that's sitting below the steamer, absorbing all the food's juices and steam. At the end of the meal, you have an insanely rich porridge to cap off your meal that contains all the meat, seafood, and veggie sweetness and essence. Amazing!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 6, 2019",
