            "review_text": "desiremmwekb10\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam2964 contributions\n0\nHealthy, simple, enjoyable food\nMar 2018 • Family\nWe went to the one in Crescent Mall. It was full packed during weekend. The food was quite good, just steaming food, yet it was very enjoyable. The seafood fits steaming cooking better than meat; however, I think mixing some beef in between the seafood make the whole meal more delicious. You don't get overwhelmed with seafood taste. The after all porridge was delicious, great way to finish a delicious, healthy meal.\nRead more\nWritten March 25, 2018",
