            "review_title": "Review at Chang Kang Kung",
            "review_text": "Emh\nSingapore, Singapore530 contributions\n0\nHealthy dinner with fantastic porridge\nMar 2018 • Friends\nMy friend recommended this to me and I am amazed at the freshness of the food and happy that i had a chance to experience steamed food, cooked above a pot of rice porridge...\n\nSo you order the fresh meat/vegetables, cook them in a steamer, and the gravy from the steamer drains into the rice porridge which is right below it. It gives the porridge lots of flavour from the ingredients you just steamed.\n\nGreat for family and friends, having a relaxing time cooking the food together and having a conversation while waiting.\nRead more\nWritten March 15, 2018",
