            "review_text": "Jangtravels\nSingapore, Singapore655 contributions\n0\nFun to cook, good to eat\nDec 2017 • Family\nThis is a steamy food place where everything is cooked through steaming - nothing fried. \n\nThere is a steam pot in the table. At the start, the waiter will pour in uncooked rice. Over that, depending on your orders, fish, prawn, seafood, vegetables, would be steamed dish by dish. The waiter will help cook the food in front if you and serve. By the end of dinner, the steam water from all the dishes you ordered would have helped cook the rice into a tasty nutritional porridge. Very nice and we were thankful our friends brought us here to the shop in vivocity.\nRead more\nWritten December 20, 2017",
